---
---

<section class="section" id="services">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="kicker">What we do</span>
      <h2>Full-scope cladding services</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        We take every job from bare frame to finished wall — no half-done work, no shortcuts.
        One crew, one point of contact, one standard: number one.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="services__grid">
      <article class="service-card">
        <div class="service-card__icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"/><line x1="3" y1="15" x2="21" y2="15"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Hebel panel installation</h3>
        <p>Full supply and installation of Hebel autoclaved aerated concrete panels for external walls, façades and feature cladding.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="service-card">
        <div class="service-card__icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Wall preparation &amp; framing</h3>
        <p>Site set-out, subframe and fixing systems, straightening and levelling — we make sure the structure is ready before a single panel goes up.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="service-card">
        <div class="service-card__icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Cutting, sealing &amp; finishing</h3>
        <p>Precision cutting around openings and corners, expansion joints, sealants and a clean, straight finish ready for paint or render.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="service-card">
        <div class="service-card__icon">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>General cladding &amp; fix-outs</h3>
        <p>Beyond Hebel, we handle general external cladding, patching, rectification and related fix-out work for homes and commercial sites.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
